  THE STATEMENT (the inversion, one line):
    CDM:      dark microhalos first (z ~ 30-60, M ~ 1e-6-1e3) -> halos grow
              -> baryons fall in (dissipative, late)  [DARK FIRST]
    FRAMEWORK: baryonic galaxies first (z > 2.4, JWST-era) -> phantom
              condenses around the wells at z* = 2.4 (galaxy class; the
              ladder sets clusters earlier, groups at the EoR) -> the dust
              completes the halos (cluster-class, growth-first)  [BARYONS
              FIRST FOR THE DRESSING; DARK FIRST FOR THE DUST]

