         reading : the framework's own science: the 600-km/s cluster-low baryonic well is 4.2e13 Msun, inside the direct pie measurement (5.5e13) and the f_dark = 6-10 conversion (2.8-4.4e13) -- the skeleton is the same object in three readings.

